>1. What do you do with statues and figurines ??

    I sometimes use figurines as a 'last-ditch' defense. If
something is really beating the crap out of you, you simply
apply the figurine and when it asks where to apply it, you
indicate the spot where the monster is and <poof> the monster
and the figurine is gone. I usually only do this with worthless
figurines like a figurine of a floating eye or a grid bug. 

    As for statues, what I remember from the older versions but
they might have changed it in the newer version; you can use a
pickaxe to break apart the statue and there might be a spellbook
inside. 
